---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { EMAIL, PLAN_URL, MAILING_ADDRESS, LEGAL_UPDATED } from '../data/site';
---
<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Journeys by Jaz"
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  description="What Journeys by Jaz collects through this website and its travel list form, how it is used and shared, how text-message consent works, and the choices you have."
  path="/privacy"
  updated={LEGAL_UPDATED}
>
  <p><strong>Journeys by Jaz</strong> is an independent travel advisor and vacation planner affiliated with Enchanted Escapes Travel (Enchanted Escapes, LLC), an Authorized Disney Vacation Planner agency in Cypress, Texas. We serve Houston-area travelers and clients online across the United States. This policy explains what we collect through this website, how we use it and the choices you have.</p>

  <h2>What this policy covers</h2>
  <p>This policy covers this website, our <a href={PLAN_URL}>travel list and planning form</a>, and the calls, emails and text messages you exchange with us. When you book travel, the details you give for the booking are also handled under the secure Enchanted Escapes Travel booking form, the privacy practices of that agency, and the policies of the travel supplier you choose (such as Disney, a cruise line or a resort). Our <a href="./terms">Terms of Service</a> apply to your use of this website and our services.</p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Travel list and planning form:</strong> your name, phone number, email address, the kind of trip you want, travel dates, budget, how many people are traveling (including children’s ages) and anything you choose to write in the notes. Form submissions are received in GoHighLevel (LeadConnector), the customer relationship management platform we use.</li>
    <li><strong>Calls, emails and texts:</strong> the messages and notes from our conversations, so we can plan your trip and follow up.</li>
    <li><strong>Text message choices:</strong> if you agree to text messages, your mobile number, which kind of texts you agreed to (service-related, promotional or both) and a record of your consent. See Text messages (SMS) below.</li>
    <li><strong>Booking details:</strong> if you choose to book, the traveler details a supplier needs, such as names as they appear on identification and dates of birth. These are collected through the secure Enchanted Escapes Travel booking form and shared with the supplier you choose.</li>
    <li><strong>Basic technical data:</strong> like most websites, our hosting and security provider (Cloudflare) may log your IP address, browser type, device type and the pages you visit, to deliver this website and protect it from attacks.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What we do not collect here</h2>
  <p>This website does not take payments and our forms never ask for your payment card number, passport number or Social Security number, and they do not accept document uploads. Please do not include any of these in a form, email or text message. Travel payments are made directly to the travel supplier, and we will tell you how to share booking details through the secure booking form.</p>

  <h2>How we use your information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To reply to your request and answer your questions.</li>
    <li>To research and prepare your 2–3 custom vacation options.</li>
    <li>To book the travel you choose, and to stay in touch before, during and after your trip.</li>
    <li>To send the text messages and emails you agreed to receive, and only those.</li>
    <li>To keep records, including your text-message consent, and to meet our legal and accounting obligations.</li>
    <li>To keep this website secure and prevent fraud or misuse.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we share your information</h2>
  <p><strong>We do not sell your personal information</strong> and we do not share it for third-party advertising. We share it only when it is needed to provide our services:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Service providers</strong> that help us run this website, our forms and our messages, such as GoHighLevel (LeadConnector), Mailgun for email delivery, our messaging platform and wireless carriers, and Cloudflare for hosting and security.</li>
    <li><strong>Enchanted Escapes Travel and travel suppliers</strong> (such as Disney, cruise lines, resorts and insurance providers) when you choose to book, so your trip can be quoted, booked and managed.</li>
    <li><strong>When the law requires it</strong>, or to protect the rights, property or safety of our clients, us or others.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Text messages (SMS)</h2>
  <p>If you choose to receive text messages from Journeys by Jaz, this section explains what we send, how your consent works and how we handle your mobile information.</p>

  <h3>Two separate, optional kinds of text</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Service-related texts:</strong> about your trip request, planning agreement and fee, delivery of your options, booking confirmations, payment reminders and trip updates.</li>
    <li><strong>Promotional texts:</strong> travel tips, deals, offers and news.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>You agree to each kind separately. Each has its own box on our forms, and the boxes are never pre-checked. You can request a trip plan without agreeing to any text messages. Consent is not a condition of purchase.</p>

  <h3>What we keep</h3>
  <p>We keep your mobile number, which kind or kinds of texts you agreed to, and a record of your consent: the date and time, the form you used, the version of the consent wording you saw, and technical details such as your IP address and browser. We keep this record so we can show when and how you agreed.</p>

  <h3>Frequency, rates, STOP and HELP</h3>
  <p>Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply. Reply <strong>STOP</strong> at any time to cancel text messages. Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for help, or email <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a>. Replying STOP ends all texts from that number. If you want to keep service-related texts and stop promotional ones, email us and tell us.</p>

  <h3>Sharing your mobile information</h3>
  <p>We do not share mobile numbers or text-message consent with third parties or affiliates for their marketing or promotional purposes. We may share this information with service providers that help us send the messages you agreed to, such as our messaging platform (GoHighLevel) and wireless carriers. Our <a href="./terms">Terms of Service</a> include the terms for text messages.</p>

  <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
  <p>This website does not use advertising cookies or tracking pixels. Our forms and booking pages are hosted by third-party providers (such as GoHighLevel and Enchanted Escapes Travel) that may use cookies needed for those pages to work. If we add analytics or other tracking tools, we will update this policy and explain how to opt out.</p>

  <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
  <p>This website links to other websites, such as travel suppliers and booking pages. We do not control them, and their privacy practices are their own.</p>

  <h2>How we protect information</h2>
  <p>We take reasonable administrative, technical and organizational steps to protect the information you give us. This website is served over an encrypted (HTTPS) connection. We limit who can see form submissions and client details to the people who need them to respond to you, and we use service providers that maintain their own security safeguards. No method of sending or storing information is completely secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security. Please do not send payment card numbers, passport numbers or Social Security numbers by regular email or text.</p>

  <h2>How long we keep information</h2>
  <p>We keep your information only as long as we need it to respond to you, plan and manage your travel, and meet legal, tax and record-keeping obligations. After that, we delete or de-identify it.</p>

  <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
  <p>You can ask us to access, correct or delete the information you sent us, unless we need to keep it for legal or record-keeping reasons. You can ask to stop receiving marketing emails or texts at any time (see Text messages above). Depending on where you live (for example, Texas or California), you may have additional rights over your personal information. We do not sell personal information. To make a request, email <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a> or use our <a href={PLAN_URL}>form</a> and tell us what you need. We may need to verify your identity before we respond.</p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This website is for adults. It is not meant for anyone under 18, and we do not knowingly collect information directly from people under 18. Parents and guardians may give us information about children who are traveling with them, such as ages or names for a booking.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top shows when it last changed.</p>

  <h2>Contact us</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy? Email <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a> or call <a href="tel:+17138870363">(713) 887-0363</a>.{MAILING_ADDRESS && <Fragment> Our business mailing address is {MAILING_ADDRESS}.</Fragment>} See also our <a href="./terms">Terms of Service</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
